ext":"주소를","x":1217,"y":956,"width":85,"height":30},{"text":"가진다","x":1313,"y":954,"width":86,"height":31}]},{"text":"현하고 MAC 주소는 16진 표기법으로 표현한다. 이 절에서는 스위치가 모든 프레임을","words":[{"text":"현하고","x":547,"y":1095,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"MAC","x":658,"y":1101,"width":84,"height":28},{"text":"주소는","x":754,"y":1098,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"16진","x":869,"y":1096,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"표기법으로","x":948,"y":1095,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"표현한다.","x":1126,"y":1097,"width":143,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1286,"y":1097,"width":29,"height":36},{"text":"절에서는","x":1333,"y":1096,"width":139,"height":37},{"text":"스위치가","x":1485,"y":1095,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"모든","x":1644,"y":1096,"width":73,"height":34},{"text":"프레임을","x":1730,"y":1095,"width":128,"height":39}]},{"text":"브로드캐스트한다고 가정한다(즉, 스위치가 한 인터페이스로 프레임을 수신하면 다른","words":[{"text":"브로드캐스트한다고","x":545,"y":1156,"width":298,"height":37},{"text":"가정한다(즉,","x":858,"y":1154,"width":184,"height":38},{"text":"스위치가","x":1058,"y":1155,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1207,"y":1156,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"인터페이스로","x":1258,"y":1155,"width":207,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":1481,"y":1155,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"수신하면","x":1641,"y":1155,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"다른","x":1799,"y":1156,"width":60,"height":38}]},{"text":"모든 인터페이스로 프레임을 전달한다). 다음 절에서는 스위치가 어떻게 동작하는지","words":[{"text":"모든","x":545,"y":1218,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"인터페이스로","x":631,"y":1216,"width":195,"height":37},{"text":"프레임을","x":842,"y":1214,"width":131,"height":37},{"text":"전달한다).","x":990,"y":1214,"width":153,"height":39},{"text":"다음","x":1163,"y":1215,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"절에서는","x":1249,"y":1215,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"스위치가","x":1403,"y":1215,"width":146,"height":37},{"text":"어떻게","x":1567,"y":1216,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"동작하는지","x":1693,"y":1216,"width":162,"height":40}]},{"text":"보다 자세하게 설명하겠다.","words":[{"text":"보다","x":544,"y":1276,"width":68,"height":37}