text":"위해서,","x":1758,"y":1459,"width":100,"height":39}]},{"text":"출발지 노드는 반드시 자신의 어댑터에게 IP 데이터그램뿐만 아니라 목적지","words":[{"text":"출발지","x":542,"y":1517,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"노드는","x":671,"y":1520,"width":106,"height":35},{"text":"반드시","x":800,"y":1518,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":927,"y":1518,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"어댑터에게","x":1058,"y":1519,"width":176,"height":38},{"text":"IP","x":1260,"y":1524,"width":38,"height":29},{"text":"데이터그램뿐만","x":1324,"y":1520,"width":271,"height":38},{"text":"아니라","x":1620,"y":1520,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"목적지","x":1758,"y":1521,"width":97,"height":39}]},{"text":"222.222.222.222의 MAC 주소도 주어야 한다. 송신 어댑터는 목적지의 MAC 주소가","words":[{"text":"222.222.222.222의","x":542,"y":1579,"width":287,"height":39},{"text":"MAC","x":844,"y":1584,"width":84,"height":29},{"text":"주소도","x":942,"y":1582,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"주어야","x":1055,"y":1580,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1169,"y":1580,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"송신","x":1259,"y":1581,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"어댑터는","x":1345,"y":1581,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"목적지의","x":1499,"y":1581,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"MAC","x":1659,"y":1585,"width":90,"height":29},{"text":"주소가","x":1764,"y":1583,"width":94,"height":37}]},{"text":"포함된 링크 계층 프레임을 구성해서 그 프레임을 랜으로 전송한다.","words":[{"text":"포함된","x":543,"y":1640,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"링크","x":657,"y":1641,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":735,"y":1641,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"프레임을","x":812,"y":1641,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"구성해서","x":954,"y":1641,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"그","x":1100,"y":1647,"width":33,"height":26},{"text":"프레임을","x":1145,"y":1641,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"랜으로","x":1295,"y":1642,"width":104,"height":36},{"text":"전송한다.","x":1413,"y":1642,"width":150,"height":38}]},{"text":"이 절에서 제기된 중요한 질문은 “송신 호스트가 어떻게 IP 주소 222.222222222","words":[{"text":"이","x":610,"y":1702,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"절에서","x":655,"y":1703,"width":94,"height":39},{"text":"제기된","x":765,"y":1703,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"중요한","x":875,"y":1703,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"질문은","x":988,"y":1702,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"“송신","x":1098,"y":1703,"width":79,"height":38},{"text":"호스트가","x":1191,"y":1703,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"어떻게","x":1342,"y":1703,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"IP","x":1459,"y":1708,"width":37,"height":29},{"text":"주소","x":1508,"y":1705,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"222.222222222","x":1595,"y":1707,"width":262,"height":32}]},{"text":"를 가진 목적지 호스트의 MAC 주소를 결정할 수 있는가”이다. 이것은 ARP를 사용함","words":[{"text":"를","x":543,"y":1765,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"가진","x":590,"y":1764,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"목적지","x":668,"y":1765,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"호스트의","x":780,"y":1764,"width":128,"height":38},{"text":"MAC","x":923,"y":1768,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"주소를","x":1021,"y":1766,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"결정할","x":1136,"y":1765,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1248,"y":1765,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있는가”이다.","x":1298,"y":1765,"width":197,"height":38},{"text":"이것은","x":1513,"y":1765,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"ARP를","x":1634,"y":1766,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"사용함","x":1764,"y":1765,"width":95,"height":39}]},{"text":"으로씨 가능해진다. 송신 호스트의 ARP 모듈은 입력값으로서 동일한 랜상의 임의의","words":[{"text":"으로씨","x":543,"y":1826,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"가능해진다.","x":660,"y":1826,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"송신","x":849,"y":1826,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"호스트의","x":930,"y":1826,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"ARP","x":1077,"y":1831,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"모듈은","x":1166,"y":1826,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"입력값으로서","x":1287,"y":1825,"width":205,"height":39},{"text":"동일한","x":1513,"y":1826,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"랜상의","x":1642,"y":1826,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"임의의","x":1767,"y":1827,"width":89,"height":39}]},{"text":"IP 주소에 대해 대응되는 MAC 주소를 돌려준다. 이 예에서, 송신 호스트","words":[{"text":"IP","x":54